pr.body:
Adds three FastMCP tools to expose the existing custom_data REST handlers via the MCP surface:
- `get_custom_data(workspace_id, category, key?)` — proxies GET /api/custom_data/{ws}
- `save_custom_data(workspace_id, category, key, value)` — proxies POST /api/custom_data/{ws}
- `delete_custom_data(workspace_id, category, key)` — proxies DELETE /api/custom_data/{ws}/{category}/{key}

Adds JSON-RPC dispatch_map entries and _get_tool_schemas entries in enhanced_server.py. Verifies save→get→delete round-trip via MCP and that `tools/list` advertises the new tools.
